# Single ignore file for the whole multi-module build: add rules here, not in the modules.

### Gradle ###
.gradle/
**/build/
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/
HELP.md

### Gradle wrapper — only the root one is used; Spring Initializr adds a copy to every new module ###
/*/gradlew
/*/gradlew.bat
/*/gradle/wrapper/

### Java crash logs ###
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

### Logs ###
*.log
logs/

### OS ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

### IntelliJ IDEA ###
.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
out/
!**/src/main/**/out/
!**/src/test/**/out/

### STS ###
.apt_generated
.classpath
.factorypath
.project
.settings
.springBeans
.sts4-cache
bin/
!**/src/main/**/bin/
!**/src/test/**/bin/

### NetBeans ###
/nbproject/private/
/nbbuild/
/dist/
/nbdist/
/.nb-gradle/

### VS Code ###
.vscode/

### Claude Code local settings ###
.claude/settings.local.json

### Local env files — contain secrets, not committed ###
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

### Google service-account credentials — promotion-forecast keeps its key here ###
**/google/*

### Business data — inputs/outputs are local working files, not source ###
**/src/main/resources/input/*
!**/src/main/resources/input/README.md
**/src/main/resources/output/*
!**/src/main/resources/output/README.md
**/plans/*.xlsx
**/holidays/*.xlsx
